<main>
    <section class="privacy-policy-section">
        <div class="privacy-policy-container">


            <h1 class="privacy-policy-title">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>

            <p>
                Birthing Kit Foundation Australia respects and honours our supporters, partners, the mothers and newborns we provide aid to, and your right to be treated courteously, fairly and have your privacy protected. Accordingly, BKFA has opted to comply with the Australian Government Privacy Act 1988 and the Australian Privacy Principles which form part of that Act, in its management of personal information and sensitive information related to race, religion, political affiliation or to any health information it may collect. BKFA follows these national principles in its collection, use, maintenance, disclosure and storage of such information.
            </p>

            <p>
                BKFA collects and uses personal information such as name, address, email address, telephone number and donation activity from membership applications, donations, and enquiries. We use your information to inform you about our activities in helping to ensure a clean and safe birth for women in developing countries, and to fundraise for those activities. We also collect information about our partners and aid recipients including photographs. We do not disclose your information to any third party except when you have given your consent or when required by law, and we keep your information in secure and password protected databases.
            </p>

            <p>
                If you would like to access the information we hold about you, correct it or have your contact details removed from our database, please contact us by email at 
                <a href="mailto:info@bkfa.org.au" class="privacy-link">info@bkfa.org.au</a> 
                or write to Birthing Kit Foundation Australia, PO Box 330, Belair, S.A. 5052.
            </p>

            <p>
                A copy of our Privacy Policy can be downloaded 
                <a href="https://www.bkfa.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Privacy-Policy.pdf" target="_blank" class="privacy-link">here</a>.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>
</main>

